{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute [[cite:obs-b81d9de0a12c2c4e84174f0c1caf3e7d70dfda17 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years, after which they are shredded [[cite:obs-3a12814f5fb94d396cfb79998b461d877a339dc1 \"Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the statute's retention rule and the duration for which records are kept, each statement followed by exact source citations as required."}